<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for expressing interest in Arizona State University. I am happy to hear you are ready to show your Sun Devil spirit.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">As an ASU student, you’ll receive a free gold ASU T-shirt when you attend <a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/orientation">New Student Orientation</a> and again during <a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/fallwelcome">Fall Welcome</a> as an ASU student!</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Until then, you can visit the official ASU Bookstore at <a href="http://www.bkstr.com/arizonastatestore/home/en?cm_mmc=Redirect-_-VanityURL-_-sundevilbookstores.com-_-196905">sundevilbookstores.com</a> for T-shirts, apparel, books accessories, collectibles, supplies, technology and gifts for the whole family.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please let me know if you have any additional questions about ASU or the admission process.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>